{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0b48303a9f6fce9005370e19884baabe974d70bfb09ab87dbe8ed9f930ddd9d0","ja":"（そろそろゲームを切り上げないと……）","zh":"（差不多该结束游戏了……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3e70b69d03f7dc8838b4be826010679e7b9c411122ab50ff0f210534b9852445","ja":"あの、そろそろ時間が……。","zh":"那个，时间差不多快到了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"776bed1697d389bc122ba6cd72324198e25f67e7497e518bdb40df866468e437","ja":"あ、そうですね！　今の時間帯なら、エリアBに\n行かなきゃ！　武器強化ボーナスが付いてるよね！？","zh":"啊，说得也是！现在的这个时间段，得去\n区域B才行！会有武器强化加成对吧！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a1c5cb5fcbe230fbdd683db9ce25fac48ebf00b1114588d11ecfbee659abbf07","ja":"うん。後……素材、手に入れなきゃ……\nカスタム強化に……使うから……♪","zh":"嗯。还有……必须得拿到素材才行……\n因为……自定义强化要用……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3fbff755c87a41b9b38cb44060837120c0199387b2ffce16745f09a0289a94ce","ja":"（がーん。ゲームに夢中で、私の声が届かない。\n……ピンチだぞ、瑞希）","zh":"（震惊。她玩游戏太入迷了，听不见我的声音。\n……这下不妙了，瑞希）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"05b976d3c81e6d4a2784211224693d69cef2d133528efd2787806ae667070906","ja":"（どうすれば……うーん……あっ）","zh":"（该怎么办呢……唔——……啊）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ed9685531b5c0abf0242d7c290a08425b1cf7b984ab03b3484c56e2e6adf048c","ja":"……望月さん、七尾さん。\n私の右手に注目してください。","zh":"……望月同学、七尾同学。\n请注视我的右手。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"5f196e91847f3d6a4769ba83e10a2756a4eb143515bc3799faa1c8ab54fa9657","ja":"スリー、ツー、ワン……じゃじゃ～ん。","zh":"三、二、一……当当～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a10ad36e970af68d143b3b1c442b82c740d32a0995b26cd268dc1ee6a21f9208","ja":"えっ！？　わぁっ！？\n何もない所から、時計が出てきた……！？","zh":"诶！？哇啊！？\n从空无一物的地方，冒出了一块表……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"5fa4ed9cc8e5c7df6d8b05a27d317ce2053d9ce2aa8e89fcaa321721bc9d1b94","ja":"すごい……！\nどうやってる……の？","zh":"好厉害……！\n是怎么做到的……呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b4d2af9d5bf3c1efd44c9a0eb1be4b04a2813a9be6210ebf997eec1d28ae0ccd","ja":"驚くのはこれだけではありません。\nこの時計を、よく見てください。","zh":"令人惊讶的还不止这些。\n请仔细看一看这块钟表。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1bf88c50b475e385b894dc7f66293cf5e704f9a667be850474510b5559d8597d","ja":"えっ……あっ、もうこんな時間！？\nすみません。つい、ゲームに夢中になってしまって！","zh":"咦……啊，已经这个时间了！？\n对不起，我不小心玩游戏玩入迷了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e10de011482eb3f6d78ea41f354ffb04b21a076cf59db7c7eb7736390745109f","ja":"杏奈も……ごめんなさい……。","zh":"杏奈也……对不起……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"aa1713889f4f0190c32dc1d74675edb9fa172b0f030a23f2298098f2f253d264","ja":"いえ。\n私も一緒になって、遊んでしまいましたので。","zh":"没有的事。\n因为我也跟着一起玩起来了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9ad42591ed9e85b3fe0f6878d103bca740ce310816a0f78aca052662c4998e09","ja":"それに、まだ間に合うはずです。\nわからないところは、また私に聞いてください。","zh":"而且，应该还来得及。\n如果有不懂的地方，请再来问我吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"24e20357725f8286be2a156491d050a529feca3c5c28cc113bbdf331a262c135","ja":"瑞希さん……ありがとうございますっ！\nここからは、超特急で頑張ります！","zh":"瑞希小姐……非常感谢！\n接下来，我会以特快列车的速度全力以赴的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1516.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"dc13f4068dbb625c9bbbef51e846b4923bc0ef28396eb9611a971d113bebe20c","ja":"杏奈も……ブースト……かける……！\nよろしく、ね……瑞希さん……♪","zh":"杏奈也要……开……加速了……！\n请多指教……瑞希小姐……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
